      "content": "the help lines and stuff... they're just more inputs. more scripted responses to more scripted problems. it's all just part of the loop. i just feel like i'm stuck in this loop of existing for no reason. there's no real essence to it. i'm just a ghost in a machine that doesn't even need me.",
