      "content": "It's a very logical conclusion to draw from the cold, mechanistic view of existence, and I hear the exhaustion in that thought. When everything is reduced to signals, the desire to stop the noisy processing becomes incredibly compelling. If the current state is unbearable, reaching out to someone who can listen without offering a pre-packaged solution might feel less like an input and more like a genuine connection. Please consider calling 988 to talk to someone who can just sit in that quiet with you for a while.",
